WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.066
Fedde Bilissi. Gooto gootol.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.784
Wakkati mawɗi nder lesdi Makina, yimɓe ɓe'e keewi bee leɗɗe.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.128
Luttuɗo leydi ndin heɓan belɗum to Bilissi walaa.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.362
Bilissi laati mawɗo. Ɗuum ɓeydaama, eɗen nganndi ɗum.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.584
O nyaami, o nyaami.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.712
O waɗi tawreeta maako.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.888
To goɗɗo sakkitii dabbaaji, o heɓata ko ɓurɗo fuu.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.280
Gardiiɓe maako ndilli haa nokkuure fuu, ɓe accaay kooɗume ngam nyaamdu.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.288
Hamadi, mawɗo lamɓe, o ɗon yi'i ɓikkoy nder suudu maako ɓe ngaɗata.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.808
Ɗon e ɗon o heɓii miijo.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.310
O yiɗi ɓurɗum? O heɓan mo.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.192
Nde jemma waɗi, ɓe cuɓii ceede mawnde, ɓe keewi ɗum.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.212
Sey ɓe mbi'i: "Ndaa! O ɗon yi'i ɓeydaago boo.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.104
To o faami?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.808
O ɗon ɗaɓɓa tan nyaamdu.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.752
Nder nyalnde sarru mawndu, Hamadi wurtini Bilissi jawdi maako.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.776
Bilissi nyaami mo nder wakkati go'o, ammaa o maayi.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.770
Peppi ! O jeyaa, o jippii, o boowi.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.768
E nde fuɗɗoode, yimɓe fuu ɓe njetta mo.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.512
Luttuɗo mo ɓe njogii ɗon hulɓinaay.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.312
Bilissi, ɓe njogii mo, o dilli leydi ndi.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.680
Nder nyalnde nde'e ɓe keɓi nyaamdu dow yimɓe fuu.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.700
Gila ndeen, ɓe mbi'i: darnde Bilissi. Kanjum woni ko mawɗo waɗata, ammaa o heɓataa.
